   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonar Music Showcase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The engagement activity targets Danish youth aged 12&#xfffd;30. The goal is to introduce music enthusiasts in Denmark to Sonar Music&#xfffd;s work in both South Africa and Denmark. In both countries, music serves as the central focus, bringing young people together to create collaboratively. In South Africa, music builds bridges across differences, promoting connection. Music also unites us across continents, and this engagement activity celebrates everything that brings us together.</narrative>
  </description>
